@startuml
[*] --> Running
Running --> Configuration : require configuration
Configuration --> Running : configuration completed
Running --> DataCollection : clock triggered
Running --> SummaryPreparation : request summary
Running --> StatusCheck : request status
DataCollection --> Running : activity completed
SummaryPreparation --> Running : activity completed
StatusCheck --> Running : activity completed
Running --> Controlled : remote control
Controlled --> ShutDown : shutdown command
Running --> ShutDown : shutdown command
ShutDown --> [*]
@enduml
